<title>USA: CBOT associate membership sells for record price.</title>
<headline>CBOT associate membership sells for record price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade (CBOT) said Monday an associate membership sold last Friday for a record $575,000.</p>
<p>The previous record was $535,000 set on March 31, it said.</p>
<p>An associate membership allows trading of all CBOT futures and options except grain and silver futures.</p>
<p>On June 5 the CBOT reached a licensing agreement with Dow Jones &amp; Co to trade futures and futures-options on the Dow Jones Industrial Average.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
